{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01407",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 6.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Mm, hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.69,
      "end_seconds": 12.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Yeah, it's sudden hearing loss in one ear. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.88,
      "end_seconds": 24.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.03,
      "end_seconds": 31.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Uh, I've had it for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.84,
      "end_seconds": 35.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.93,
      "end_seconds": 49.57,
      "duration_seconds": 13.64,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a blocked feeling as well. Uh, the blocked feeling? That's been for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.85,
      "end_seconds": 55.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.0,
      "end_seconds": 59.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.91,
      "end_seconds": 80.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Okay, a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.36,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.14,
      "end_seconds": 118.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the the past? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.09,
      "end_seconds": 129.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "I have migraines, for two years i told my wife I'd come today. High cholesterol, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.46,
      "end_seconds": 139.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "Alright, high cholesterol, that matches what I have here. Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.91,
      "end_seconds": 152.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Sumatriptan. I take it 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines. Uh, I'm on atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.23,
      "end_seconds": 155.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.05,
      "end_seconds": 160.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "No, you know, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.09,
      "end_seconds": 165.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Right, any ear pain, facial weakness or dizziness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.24,
      "end_seconds": 168.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.72,
      "end_seconds": 171.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "How about discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.65,
      "end_seconds": 176.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.57,
      "end_seconds": 183.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "right, how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.8,
      "end_seconds": 190.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 191.92,
      "end_seconds": 206.3,
      "duration_seconds": 14.38,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 83 beats a minute, saturation 98 percent, height 155 centimetres. Respiratory rate 15, pressure 126 over 78, weight 79 kilos, temperature 36.8."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.13,
      "end_seconds": 208.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.04,
      "end_seconds": 213.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.11,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.64,
      "end_seconds": 219.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.55,
      "end_seconds": 244.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "The ear drum looks normal and the tuning fork is heard louder in the other ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.58,
      "end_seconds": 264.27,
      "duration_seconds": 14.69,
      "text": "so, good, you can sit up again having listened and examined, this is probably sudden hearing loss needing urgent treatment i can't rule out a wax or fluid blockage yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.48,
      "end_seconds": 267.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.97,
      "end_seconds": 279.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with sudden hearing loss needing urgent treatment do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.68,
      "end_seconds": 298.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an MRI scan for sudden hearing loss. So, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.19,
      "end_seconds": 302.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}